    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a tool for understanding patterns in the world, not just abstract rules. My upper secondary education introduced me to its beauty through problem-solving, but I’ve always preferred connecting it to real-life applications like cooking measurements or hiking trails. It’s practical, not intimidating.",
